# 🏥 ECO Plus Diagnostic Center

**Accurate Diagnosis. Better Health.**

ECO Plus Diagnostic Center is a modern, mobile-responsive diagnostic healthcare website designed for managing diagnostic services, available tests, appointment requests, and essential center information.

📍 **Location:** পাবনা সদর হাসপাতালের সামনে, পাবনা, বাংলাদেশ  
📞 **Contact:** ০১৭১১-১৯৪২২৫  
👤 **Chairman:** সাজ্জতুল ইসলাম নাদিম খান

---

## ✨ Features

- 📱 Mobile-first responsive design
- 🏥 Diagnostic Services section
- 🧪 Available Tests section
- 🩸 Blood Test information
- ❤️ ECG service
- 🔬 Ultrasound service
- 📅 Online Appointment Request
- 📞 Direct phone call support
- 👤 Chairman Profile
- 🔐 Admin Login Portal
- 📊 Admin Dashboard
- 🗂️ Appointment management
- ⚙️ Flask/Jinja backend support
- 🔌 REST API-ready appointment system
- 🚀 Production deployment ready

